<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Crimean War Episodes - Operation Tiger Rifle, 2014</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P lang=es-ES class=western style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 12px/20px Tahoma, Verdana, Arial; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0.19in 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;By Baloogan &lt;A href="http://baloogancampaign.com"&gt;http://baloogancampaign.com&lt;/A&gt; &lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P lang=es-ES class=western style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 12px/20px Tahoma, Verdana, Arial; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0.19in 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;ATTN: Commanding Officer,&lt;SPAN class=Apple-converted-space&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;EM&gt;EUCOM&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P lang=es-ES class=western style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 12px/20px Tahoma, Verdana, Arial; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0.19in 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;You are instructed to initiate OPERATION TIGER RIFLE. Your control center is airborne, aboard a E-8C JSTARS of the 116th Air Control Wing. &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P lang=es-ES class=western style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 12px/20px Tahoma, Verdana, Arial; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0.19in 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;INTEL/SITREP&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P lang=es-ES class=western style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 12px/20px Tahoma, Verdana, Arial; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0.19in 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;The Russian Federation has taken Crimea by force and within 48 hours a major NATO assault is planned. You must clear the way for the HW Bush to lead an amphibious assault group. Destruction of the 11th Anti-submarine Ship Brigade and (most importantly) the S-400 and Bastion ASM located near Sevastopol is required for the amphibious landing. &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P lang=es-ES class=western style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 12px/20px Tahoma, Verdana, Arial; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0.19in 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;ENEMY FORCES&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P lang=es-ES class=western style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 12px/20px Tahoma, Verdana, Arial; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0.19in 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;Russia has significant air assets; but will be taken by suprise by a quick, sharp assualt.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P lang=es-ES class=western style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 12px/20px Tahoma, Verdana, Arial; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0.19in 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;11th Anti-submarine Ship Brigade&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P lang=es-ES class=western style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 12px/20px Tahoma, Verdana, Arial; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0.19in 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;'Bastion' ASM TELs&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P lang=es-ES class=western style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 12px/20px Tahoma, Verdana, Arial; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0.19in 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;'S-400' SAM TELs&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P lang=es-ES class=western style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 12px/20px Tahoma, Verdana, Arial; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0.19in 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;Assorted captured Ukranian SAM and Radar.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P lang=es-ES class=western style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 12px/20px Tahoma, Verdana, Arial; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0.19in 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;6972nd Guards Aviation Base [Su-27S Flanker B] &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P lang=es-ES class=western style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 12px/20px Tahoma, Verdana, Arial; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0.19in 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;968th Interceptor Aviation Regiment [MiG-29 Fulcrum A]&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P lang=es-ES class=western style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 12px/20px Tahoma, Verdana, Arial; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0.19in 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;FRIENDLY FORCES&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P lang=es-ES class=western style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 12px/20px Tahoma, Verdana, Arial; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0.19in 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;Your task force consists of&amp;nbsp;&lt;BR&gt;CARSTRKGRU 2&lt;BR&gt;CVW 8&lt;BR&gt;Iowa SSGN&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P lang=es-ES class=western style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 12px/20px Tahoma, Verdana, Arial; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0.19in 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;Based out of Romania&lt;BR&gt;31st Fighter Wing [F-16C]&lt;BR&gt;48th Fighter Wing [F-15]&lt;BR&gt;116th Air Control Wing [E-8C]&lt;BR&gt;2nd Bomb Wing [B-52H]&lt;BR&gt;100th Air Refueling Wing [KC-135]&lt;BR&gt;NATO E-3A Squadron 1 [E-3A]&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P lang=es-ES class=western style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 12px/20px Tahoma, Verdana, Arial; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0.19in 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;MISSION&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P lang=es-ES class=western style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 12px/20px Tahoma, Verdana, Arial; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0.19in 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;Destroy the 11th Anti-submarine Ship Brigade, S-400 SAM, Bastion ASM near Crimea. &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P lang=es-ES class=western style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 12px/20px Tahoma, Verdana, Arial; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0.19in 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;EXECUTION&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P lang=es-ES class=western style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 12px/20px Tahoma, Verdana, Arial; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0.19in 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;Attack at your &lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); TEXT-ALIGN: justify; FONT: 14px/19px georgia, 'times new roman', times, serif; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;discretion&lt;/SPAN&gt;. &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P lang=es-ES class=western style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 12px/20px Tahoma, Verdana, Arial; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0.19in 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;COMMAND AND SIGNAL&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P lang=es-ES class=western style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 12px/20px Tahoma, Verdana, Arial; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0.19in 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;Command:&lt;SPAN class=Apple-converted-space&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;116th Air Control Wing&lt;BR&gt;Signal: EMCON State C (Unrestricted Emissions)&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P lang=es-ES class=western style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(68,68,68); PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 12px/20px Tahoma, Verdana, Arial; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0.19in 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;Good luck.&lt;/P&gt;Do not distribute this scenario or a modified version without permission from Baloogan who can be reached at &lt;A href="mailto:baloogan@gmail.com"&gt;baloogan@gmail.com&lt;/A&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
